.SS "\fBp4est_locidx_t\fP p8est_mesh_get_neighbors (\fBp8est_t\fP * p4est, \fBp8est_ghost_t\fP * ghost, \fBp8est_mesh_t\fP * mesh, \fBp4est_locidx_t\fP curr_quad_id, \fBp4est_locidx_t\fP direction, sc_array_t * neighboring_quads, sc_array_t * neighboring_encs, sc_array_t * neighboring_qids)"

.PP
Lookup neighboring quads of quadrant in a specific direction\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fI\fBp4est\fP\fP Forest to be worked with\&. 
.br
\fIghost\fP Ghost quadrants\&. 
.br
\fImesh\fP Mesh structure\&. 
.br
\fIcurr_quad_id\fP Process-local ID of current quad\&. 
.br
\fIdirection\fP Direction in which to look for adjacent quadrants is encoded as follows: 0 \&.\&. 5 neighbor(-s) across f_i, 6 \&.\&. 17 neighbor(-s) across e_{i-6} 18 \&.\&. 25 neighbor(-s) across c_{i-18} 
.br
\fIneighboring_quads\fP Array containing neighboring quad(-s) Needs to be empty, contains p4est_quadrant_t*\&. May be NULL, then \fBneighboring_qids\fP must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fIneighboring_encs\fP Array containing encodings for neighboring quads as described below Needs to be empty, contains int\&. CAUTION: Note, that the encodings differ from the encodings saved in the mesh\&. Positive values are for local quadrants, negative values indicate ghost quadrants\&. Faces: 1 \&.\&. 24 => same size neighbor (r * 6 + nf) + 1; nf = 0 \&.\&. 5 face index; r = 0 \&.\&. 3 relative orientation 25 \&.\&. 120 => double size neighbor 25 + h * 24 + r * 6 + nf; h = 0 \&.\&. 3 number of the subface; r, nf as above 121 \&.\&. 144 => half size neighbors 121 + r * 6 + nf; r, nf as above Edges: 1 \&.\&. 24 => same size neighbor r * 12 + ne + 1; ne = 0 \&.\&. 11 edge index; r = 0 \&.\&. 1 relative orientation 25 \&.\&. 72 => double size neighbor 25 + h * 24 + r * 12 + ne; h = 0 \&.\&. 1 number of the subedge; r, ne as above 73 \&.\&. 96 => half size neighbors 73 + r * 12 + ne; r, ne as above Corners: 1 \&.\&. 8 => nc + 1; nc = 0 \&.\&. 7 corner index 
.br
\fIneighboring_qids\fP Array containing quadrant ids for neighboring quadrants\&. May be NULL, then no neighboring qids are collected\&. If non-NULL the array needs to be empty and will contain int\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBp8est_quadrant_t\fP* p8est_mesh_get_quadrant (\fBp8est_t\fP * p4est, \fBp8est_mesh_t\fP * mesh, \fBp4est_locidx_t\fP qid)"

.PP
Access a process-local quadrant inside a forest\&. Needs a mesh with populated quad_to_tree array\&. This is a special case of \fBp8est_mesh_quadrant_cumulative\fP\&.
