.SS "\fBp8est_mesh_t\fP* p8est_mesh_new (\fBp8est_t\fP * p8est, \fBp8est_ghost_t\fP * ghost, \fBp8est_connect_type_t\fP btype)"

.PP
Create a p8est_mesh structure\&. This function does not populate the quad_to_tree and quad_level fields and ignores corner neighbors across edge-hanging corners\&. To populate them, use \fBp8est_mesh_new_params\fP\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fI\fBp8est\fP\fP A forest that is fully 2:1 balanced\&. 
.br
\fIghost\fP The ghost layer created from the provided \fBp4est\fP\&. 
.br
\fIbtype\fP Determines the highest codimension of neighbors\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
A fully allocated mesh structure\&. 
.RE
.PP

